{% if sections.system_info %}
## System Information

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **OS** | {{ shell("uname -s") | trim }} {{ shell("uname -r") | trim }} |
| **Architecture** | {{ shell("uname -m") | trim }} |
| **Uptime** | {{ shell("uptime | sed 's/.*up //' | sed 's/,.*//'") | trim }} |
{% if shell("which sw_vers 2>/dev/null") | trim %}
| **macOS Version** | {{ shell("sw_vers -productVersion") | trim }} |
{% endif %}
| **Shell** | {{ shell("echo $SHELL") | trim }} |
| **Python** | {{ shell("python3 --version 2>/dev/null || echo 'Not installed'") | trim }} |
