{% if sections.disk_usage %}
## Disk Usage

```
{{ shell("df -h | grep -E '^/dev|^Filesystem'") }}
```

{% set disk_info = shell("df -h / | tail -1 | awk '{print $5}' | tr -d '%'") | trim | int %}
{% if disk_info >= thresholds.disk_critical %}
⚠️ **CRITICAL:** Root filesystem is {{ disk_info }}% full (threshold: {{ thresholds.disk_critical }}%)
{% elif disk_info >= thresholds.disk_warning %}
⚡ **WARNING:** Root filesystem is {{ disk_info }}% full (threshold: {{ thresholds.disk_warning }}%)
{% else %}
✅ Root filesystem usage is healthy ({{ disk_info }}%)
{% endif %}

{% endif %}

{% if sections.network %}
## Network

### Active Interfaces

```
{{ shell("ifconfig | grep -E '^[a-z]|inet ' | grep -v '127.0.0.1' | head -20") }}
```

### Listening Ports

| Port | Process |
|------|---------|
{% for line in shell("lsof -iTCP -sTCP:LISTEN -P -n 2>/dev/null | tail -10 | awk '{print $9, $1}'").strip().split('\n') %}
{% if line.strip() %}
| {{ line.split()[0] if line.split() else '-' }} | {{ line.split()[1] if line.split()|length > 1 else '-' }} |
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}

{% if sections.git_repos %}
## Git Repositories

Recent git activity in current directory tree:

| Repository | Branch | Status | Last Commit |
|------------|--------|--------|-------------|
{% for repo in shell("find . -name .git -type d -maxdepth 3 2>/dev/null | head -10 | sed 's/\\.git$//'").strip().split('\n') %}
{% if repo.strip() %}
{% set branch = shell("git -C '" + repo + "' branch --show-current 2>/dev/null") | trim %}
{% set status = shell("git -C '" + repo + "' status --porcelain 2>/dev/null | wc -l") | trim %}
{% set last_commit = shell("git -C '" + repo + "' log -1 --format='%ar' 2>/dev/null") | trim %}
| `{{ repo }}` | {{ branch if branch else 'detached' }} | {{ status }} changes | {{ last_commit if last_commit else 'N/A' }} |
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}

